Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: fit box stock to the models by a separate allowance
 per side

The Stock page's "Per side" option (box stock) replaces the single fit
margin with six allowances - -X, +X, -Y, +Y, bottom, top - and Fit to
Models wraps the models' box by each side's own amount through the same
undoable SetStock (new stock::fit_box_sides; a negative or non-finite
allowance is refused by name).

Fixes #198

